# Wake tick

The always-on tick is a keepalive. The GitHub Actions runner is the repository-side keepalive for this same session. Neither one assigns work or stops work.

Follow `docs/governance/AGENT-EXECUTION.md`. Where a tick message disagrees with that document, that document wins. An unapproved Cursor workaround is denied.
